            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Rung Xanh Crocodile Farm and Restaurant",
            "review_text": "James O\nCork, Ireland1223 contributions\n0\nWorth a visit to see and eat Crocodile\nMay 2016 • Couples\nThis place is well worth a visit to take a break and to try some crocodile at their onsite restaurant, you also have the opportunity to observe the pens of differing sized crocodile and even buy something made from crocodile in the onsite shop.\nNice place to chill out for an hour or so.\nIf you are white be prepared for the locals wanting to take pictures of their children with you which to be fair is not at all intrusive and they are very polite.\nI very much enjoyed my visit and its a little expensive but I would certainly recommend it if you have a chance.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 5, 2016",
